{
  "version": 1,
  "_readme": [
    "CANONICAL COMMERCE ACTION FIXTURES — one file, three consumers (cross-platform CCP, 14 Sep 2026).",
    "",
    "The Commerce Capability Platform resolves a user's intent into a Commerce Link ONCE, on the",
    "server, and projects it as an ordinary Action: on the live place card (`8:` annotation,",
    "LiveAction.commerce) and on the Shopping card ([TAPPY_SHOPPING], SynthesisCommerceView).",
    "Web, Android and iOS each RENDER that action; none of them resolves, ranks, relabels or",
    "rewrites it. These cases pin what every renderer must preserve from the same canonical action:",
    "provider · capability · label key · depth · loginRequired · commerce facts · action id ·",
    "handoff target — and what it must never do (turn TikTok Shop into Shopee, open a retired grammar).",
    "",
    "CONSUMERS (all three MUST pass every case):",
    "  Web      src/lib/recommendation/crossPlatformCommerceContract.test.ts  (executes the resolver + validator)",
    "  Android  android/app/src/test/java/com/tappyai/app/chat/CommerceActionContractTest.kt",
    "  iOS      ios/TappyAITests/CommerceActionContractTests.swift",
    "",
    "`action` is the wire shape of LiveAction (labelKey already RESOLVED by the server).",
    "`expect.labelKey` is the key each client must render — from its own dictionary, never re-derived.",
    "A shopping view with no labelKey (a marker written before the field existed) is the one place the platforms differ on purpose: web re-resolves the key from the facts (expect.labelKey); a native client never re-derives and renders the honest fallback (expect.nativeLabelKey: view on / search on) — never a stronger verb.",
    "`expect.labelVi` is the web dictionary's rendering; native dictionaries must say the same thing.",
    "`expect.handoffBody` is what POST /api/commerce/handoff receives when the action is tapped",
    "(opaque ids only; the client adds its own `platform`).",
    "`retiredGrammars` are URL prefixes no client may ever open for these merchants."
  ],
  "commerceLabelKeys": [
    "v3.action.purchase", "v3.action.purchaseOn", "v3.action.purchaseLoginOn", "v3.action.purchaseAppOn",
    "v3.action.booking", "v3.action.bookingOn", "v3.action.bookingLoginOn", "v3.action.bookingAppOn",
    "v3.action.reservation", "v3.action.reservationOn", "v3.action.reservationLoginOn", "v3.action.reservationAppOn",
    "v3.action.ticket", "v3.action.ticketOn", "v3.action.ticketLoginOn", "v3.action.ticketAppOn",
    "v3.action.order", "v3.action.orderOn", "v3.action.orderLoginOn", "v3.action.orderAppOn",
    "v3.action.delivery", "v3.action.deliveryOn", "v3.action.deliveryLoginOn", "v3.action.deliveryAppOn",
    "v3.action.viewOn",
    "v3.action.searchOn", "v3.action.searchLoginOn", "v3.action.searchGeneric",
    "v3.action.bookingSearch", "v3.action.ticketSearch", "v3.action.orderSearch"
  ],
